        <mxCell id="c91" value="&lt;i&gt;Outlined in coral: the Difference of each year-end, the parts less the ledger, which is zero at all three (-0.0 is a rounding residue). The editor is scrolled to the closing SELECT; its CTEs sum the opening entry, the freight and the ledger, and the view OpenAccruals holds the accruals still open.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="686" width="860" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
